meta {
  name: Upload documents
  type: http
  seq: 10
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/users/me/files
  body: multipartForm
  auth: none
}

body:multipart-form {
  govCard: @file()
  experienceForm: @file()
  photo: @file()
}

docs {
  User login (cookie Authentication_User): run "User auth / Login" first. Approved users only (otherwise 403 user not validated). Document upload: allowed only while the request status is 1 (first upload) or 6 (correction after a failed check), otherwise 403 "documents can be uploaded only at request status 1, 6". On success the user moves to status 4. `govCard` is a PDF of at most 10 MB, required unless the user already has one (400 "govcard is required"); `experienceForm` is an optional PDF of at most 10 MB. `photo` is a JPG or PNG that replaces the current photo; it is optional, except for a request for a new card (Request Types 2-11) when the user has no stored photo (400 "photo is required").
}
